          deckDescription: 'A 48-card deck made by removing all Twos and Jokers from a standard French deck. Four suits (Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades), twelve ranks per suit: A, K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3. Used for Sasaki and related climbing games.',
